# EBI lobby terminals. Public notices; Eschaton's version of everything.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Notices

%rec: Nodes

name: Notices
npc: ESCHATON BUREAU OF INTEGRATION // PUBLIC NOTICES
+ 1. Curfew in the eastern rim is extended.
+ 2. The south gate incident is closed. Report rumours to your district officer.
+ 3. Golden Ticket draws continue as scheduled.
#
o_text: How many died at the south gate?
o_id: ebi_gate
o_goto: Gate
#
o_text: (Log off.)
o_id: ebi_leave
o_goto: End

name: Gate
npc: QUERY REFUSED. Clearance: none. This request has been logged.
#
o_text: (Log off.)
o_id: gate_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: The notices scroll on.
effect: EndConversation
